      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَعْسِ بِهِ</span></b>  means <i>How well adapted</i> or <i>disposed,</i>
or <i>how apt, meet, suited, suitable, fitted, fit, competent,</i> or <i>proper,</i> or <i>how worthy, is he!</i> (Lh,
K, TA.)

